/**
 * KISAN ROUTE — working simulated demo
 * -------------------------------------
 * This is a self-contained, fully working demo of the app described in
 * the brief: Provider (farmer), Customer (buyer), and Driver accounts
 * that interact through a shared marketplace, using the SAME data flow
 * as the real backend code (see the delivered project for the real,
 * deployable version).
 *
 * Since this runs inside a chat artifact rather than a real phone/server:
 *  - OTP is shown directly on screen instead of being texted (no real SMS gateway here)
 *  - UPI payment is simulated as instantly successful (no real bank connection here)
 *  - Driver GPS is simulated by animating a marker from pickup to drop
