 * purchases, inventory updates, shipment creation & payout math — is
 * real logic, not just a mockup.
 *
 * Data is stored with window.storage (shared = true) so if you open this
 * artifact in two browser tabs, actions in one (e.g. a farmer listing a
 * crop) show up in the other (e.g. a customer buying it).
 */

